# Build context sent to the daemon for every image build. Without this it carries the
# local bin/ and obj/ trees - around 337MB - none of which is used, since both Dockerfiles
# restore and publish from source inside the image.
**/bin/
**/obj/

.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

**/TestResults/
coveragereport/

docs/
*.md
!README.md

**/.dockerignore
**/Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml

**/*.user
**/appsettings.*.local.json
